# FloqAi / BOT DEE page

Resume: `@floqai-page$` / `@botdee$`.

## Product shape (Phase 1)

`floqai.html` is a **chat shell** (BOT DEE) wired to Cloud Function `executeBotSession`, with **Quick intent search** kept as a collapsible fast path / fallback (same `intent-search.js` used in feature searches).

| Piece | Role |
|---|---|
| Chat | `bot-dee-chat.js` → `executeBotSession` (Auth + `floqAi` gate + classification → Gemini + `contextualSearch`) |
| Intent fallback | `#botDeeIntentFallback` + `#intentSearchPage` — feature-optimized router cards |
| Chrome | Early-paint Site chrome; left BOT DEE icon (`data-floqr-chrome-icon="floqAi"`); compact left Back; no FloqR parent logo |

## Routing

| Entry | Target |
|---|---|
| Profile card FloqAi (`FLOQRNav.intentSearchHome()`) | `./floqai.html` |
| Search tile `#intentSearchBtnCard` | `./floqai.html?from=search` |
| Feature catalog route | `./floqai.html` |
| Old `./?start=intent|ask|wish[&q=]` | `location.replace(./floqai.html[?q=])` |
| `floqai-search.html` | redirect to `floqai.html` |

## Access

`<body data-floqr-feature="floqAi">` — off / not granted → not-available card + Back. Satellite session shell. Chat callable requires signed-in + feature gate. Intent cards still use `getFloqAiAccess` / packaged classification.

## Backend (Phase 1)

- `functions/bot-dee-functions.js` — `executeBotSession`
- `functions/bot-dee-core.js` — tools, scoring, sanitization
- Catalog: `node scripts/build-bot-dee-search-catalog.js`
- Later: VIP / ShoutOut / FloqCAST / pay tools wrapping existing callables (each re-validates role)

## Owner action

FloqAi stays invisible until Master Admin → Features & Services sets **FloqAi** Live/Test. Deploy Functions for `executeBotSession` + `GEMINI_API_KEY` before chat answers via Gemini (local `contextualSearch` fallback works without Gemini).

Tests: `functions/floqai-page.test.js`, `functions/bot-dee-core.test.js`.
